                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C(X)
            taken to be given by
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi QC
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi X
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} QC(X)
            was discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              David Ben-Zvi, John Francis, David Nadler,
              %em Integral Transforms and Drinfeld Centers in Derived Algebraic Geometry
              (
              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0805.0157"}> arXiv
              )
          %p
